ounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Tailwind CSS</span></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 p-5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-default\" style=\"--accent:#10b981;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 rounded-t-2xl scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300 origin-left\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, #10b981, transparent)\"></div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background:#10b98118;color:#10b981\"><svg class=\"remixicon-icon \" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 11h14V5H5v6zm16-7v16a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1zm-2 9H5v6h14v-6zM7 15h3v2H7v-2zm0-8h3v2H7V7z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white leading-snug\">Backend &amp; APIs</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500\">Robust and scalable backend services</p></div><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Design and implement backend systems and RESTful APIs to support web and mobile applications. Emphasis on data integrity, performance, and clear service architecture.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-auto pt-2 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-70