ss the system.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-auto pt-2 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">React</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Node.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Next.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">SQL</span></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 p-5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-default\" style=\"--accent:#60a5fa;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 rounded-t-2xl scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300 origin-left\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, #60a5fa, transparent)\"></div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background:#60a5fa18;color:#60a5fa\"><svg class=\"remixicon-icon \" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M11 19V9H4v10h7zm0-12V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h9a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v16a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8zm2-2v14h7V5h-7zM5 16h5v2H5v-2zm9 0h5v2h-5v-2zm0-3h5v2h-5v-2zm0-3h5v2h-5v-2zm-9 3h5v2H5v-2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white leading-snug\">Database Design</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500\">Structured and efficient data systems</p></div><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Design relational database schemas and optimize data storage solutions to ensure consistency, scalability, and efficient querying.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-auto pt-2 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">PostgreSQL</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">MySQL</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">SQL</span></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 p-5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-default\" style=\"--accent:#f87171;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 rounded-t-2xl scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300 origin-left\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, #f87171, transparent)\"></div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background:#f8717118;color:#f87171\"><svg class=\"remixicon-icon \" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13 19.9a5.002 5.002 0 0 0 4-4.9v-3a4.98 4.98 0 0 0-.415-2h-9.17A4.98 4.98 0 0 0 7 12v3a5.002 5.002 0 0 0 4 4.9V14h2v5.9zm-7.464-2.21A6.979 6.979 0 0 1 5 15H2v-2h3v-1c0-.643.087-1.265.249-1.856L3.036 8.866l1-1.732L6.056 8.3a7.01 7.01 0 0