-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500\">Live Examples</span><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400\"></div></div><div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800\"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight\">See it in action</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Interactive demos of website types I can build for you — fully functional, animated, production-quality.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444)\"></div><span class=\"relative z-10 transition-colors duration-150 text-white\">01<!-- --> <!-- -->Portfolio Website</span></button><button class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer\"><span class=\"relative z-10 transition-colors duration-150 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-800 dark:hover:text-zinc-200\">02<!-- --> <!-- -->Digital Gallery</span></button><button class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer\"><span class=\"relative z-10 transition-colors duration-150 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-800 dark:hover:text-zinc-200\">03<!-- --> <!-- -->Online Shop</span></button><button class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer\"><span class=\"relative z-10 transition-colors duration-150 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-800 dark:hover:text-zinc-200\">04<!-- --> <!-- -->Restaurant Menu</span></button><butto